  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICMPS - MEXICO 2021 IMDHD</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will provide leadership and management training for women who are members of family collectives searching for missing persons in Guanajuato. This training also has the objective of strengthening their ability to demand for truth and justice, as well as strengthening their organization skills by facilitating spaces for dialogue in which women will be able to share ideas, expand their cooperation networks, and create alliances.</narrative>
  </description>
